{"4241390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WARCOM: Fortress Europe", "steam_appid": 4241390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/dde47420bc6cd52dbb68145f9212e180.poster.avif?t=1785942764\" aria-label=\"Urban Combat\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/dde47420bc6cd52dbb68145f9212e180.webm?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/dde47420bc6cd52dbb68145f9212e180.mp4?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Systemic Operational-Tactical Wargame</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across Western Europe in a campaign where logistics, maneuver, and battlefield success determine the course of the war. A strategic hex map underpins a seamless, procedurally generated campaign. From high-level planning down to individual shell impacts, every decision permanently shapes the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operational planning and tactical combat unfold on the same persistent battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/8f642db31ac6b4c7faa84b7fa2b0c016.poster.avif?t=1785942764\" aria-label=\"Winter Strafe\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/8f642db31ac6b4c7faa84b7fa2b0c016.webm?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/8f642db31ac6b4c7faa84b7fa2b0c016.mp4?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operational Layer: Battalion-Level Warfare in Full 3D</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish front lines, logistics, and defenses across a massive 3D hex map of Western Europe. Every tactical battle takes place directly on terrain generated from the operational campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each campaign is shaped by interconnected systems:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fuel, ammunition, and reinforcements through road networks and supply depots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum, casualties, and reinforcement levels reshape front lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and terrain affect mobility, visibility, and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic AI identifies weak points, executes offensives, and disrupts supply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A command-point system rewards coordinated, efficient planning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever enemy formations collide, the campaign seamlessly transitions into a real-time tactical battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/910e4b054deb88343bfd500b3be515fa.poster.avif?t=1785942764\" aria-label=\"Operation Movement\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/910e4b054deb88343bfd500b3be515fa.webm?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/910e4b054deb88343bfd500b3be515fa.mp4?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Layer: Command Down to the Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of infantry, armor, support weapons, and aircraft in tense real-time battles on procedurally generated terrain generated from the operational layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic armor penetration based on projectile ballistics and impact angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppression, morale, cover, and line of sight are modeled in full 3D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating destruction: breach walls, level buildings, reshape defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue precise movement and attack orders with live path previews</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive AI employs flanking, suppression, and coordinated counterattacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory and defeat reshapes the operational campaign and the course of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/98c54cdf78b7ac877b7cca9c099cea36.poster.avif?t=1785942764\" aria-label=\"Dark Forest\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/98c54cdf78b7ac877b7cca9c099cea36.webm?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/98c54cdf78b7ac877b7cca9c099cea36.mp4?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Units Forged in Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your force evolves throughout the war, carrying experience, fatigue, and losses into every new engagement.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and improve unit attributes with each battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn commendations for standout actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle fatigue, attrition, and reduced cohesion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain HQ support and stable supply lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage ammo, fuel, and casualties through the campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A battle-hardened company in 1945 fights nothing like the same unit on D-Day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/ea1b44dff612fee5927cd2e1b059bb2a.poster.avif?t=1785942764\" aria-label=\"Allied Tank Platoon\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/ea1b44dff612fee5927cd2e1b059bb2a.webm?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/ea1b44dff612fee5927cd2e1b059bb2a.mp4?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Different Campaign Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural terrain, dynamic enemy plans, authentic orders of battle, and countless alternate possibilities ensure no two campaigns unfold the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic campaign spanning battalion-level operations and squad-level tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex-based strategic map with procedural cities, roads, terrain, and weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time tactical battles with full pause and intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent formations, convoy behavior, and movement previews</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulated Battlefield destruction across the campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep logistics, movement, and command-point systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI at both operational and tactical levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed ballistic, suppression, cover, and morale simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent experience, fatigue, and cohesion for every unit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of historical units with real-world data on armor and weaponry</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/dde47420bc6cd52dbb68145f9212e180.poster.avif?t=1785942764\" aria-label=\"Urban Combat\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/dde47420bc6cd52dbb68145f9212e180.webm?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241390/extras/dde47420bc6cd52dbb68145f9212e180.mp4?t=1785942764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Systemic Operational-Tactical Wargame</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across Western Europe in a campaign where logistics, maneuver, and battlefield success determine the course of the war. A strategic hex map underpins a seamless, procedurally generated campaign. From high-level planning down to individual shell impacts, every decision permanently shapes the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operational planning and tactical combat unfold on the same persistent battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share